# Local credential / config overrides (mirrors the esp32 repo).
#
# The glob matters: an exact "include/secrets.h" does not cover the .bak/.orig
# copies that get made while swapping credentials in and out during bench work,
# and one `git add -A` then commits a WiFi password. Match anything that starts
# with the name, and keep the checked-in template explicitly.
include/secrets.h*
!include/secrets.example.h

# Local-only Claude Code project guidance (not shared)
CLAUDE.md
